index 000000000000..230d2c7cf583
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/67983.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+In multimaster configurations, scheduled jobs are now executed by only one minion instance (the schedule leader) instead of once per connected master, preventing duplicate scheduled job runs and duplicate returns.
